## Development

```bash
uv sync                              # install deps
uv run pre-commit install            # hooks (commit + pre-push)
uv run just                          # list available justfile recipes
uv run just fix                      # format/fix + run all 12 repo quality gates quietly
uv run just changed                  # fast gate on all git-changed Python files
./scripts/map.sh                     # compact AST map (files, line ranges, typed signatures, class fields)
./scripts/check.sh --fix src/file.py # fast single-file gate + matching test
./scripts/check.sh --fix --changed   # fast gate on all git-changed Python files
./scripts/check.sh --fix             # format/fix + run all 12 repo quality gates quietly
```

Individual checks (all orchestrated by `./scripts/check.sh`; see `AGENTS.md` and `pyproject.toml` for gate rules):

```bash
uv run just audit                      # codeaudit SAST + pip-audit CVE check
uv run pytest -q path::test_name       # fast single test (no coverage table)
uv run pytest --cov                    # full test suite + >=80% branch coverage
```

Pre-commit runs ruff + hygiene checks; pre-push and CI run `./scripts/check.sh`.

